            "name": "Legacy of the Great Crusade",
            "text": "An Army with this Provenance gains the following benefits: All Models with the Irregulars Special Rule in this Army which don’t have any version of the Expendable (X) Special Rule have their Base Ballistic Skill Characteristic modified by +1. The following item is added to the Militia Armaments list: - Lasrifle +1 points The following item is added to the Militia Special Weapons list: - Rotor cannon +10 points"
        }
    },
